{'symbol': 'ROK', 'date': '2022-11-16 13:00:00', 'title': 'FORD MOTOR COMPANY SELECTS ROCKWELL AUTOMATION TO ADVANCE ITS ELECTRIC VEHICLE PROGRAM', 'text': "MILWAUKEE--( BUSINESS WIRE )--ROCKWELL AUTOMATION, INC. (NYSE: ROK), THE WORLD'S LARGEST COMPANY DEDICATED TO INDUSTRIAL AUTOMATION AND DIGITAL TRANSFORMATION, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT FORD MOTOR COMPANY HAS SELECTED ROCKWELL AS ITS VEHICLE OPERATIONS PRIMARY CONTROLS AND SOLUTIONS PROVIDER FOR ITS NEXT THREE ELECTRIC VEHICLE ASSEMBLY SITES. BY JOINTLY COLLABORATING ON ASSEMBLY TOOLING DESIGNS AND ARCHITECTURES THAT WILL INCREASE SPEED TO MARKET, ROCKWELL CAN HELP MACHINE BUILDERS TO MEET PRODUCTION CUSTOMER DEMANDS AND ACHIEVE ON-TIME SUCCESSFUL LAUNCHES."}